<title>FRANCE: Rouen Dec 1-18 grain exports at 654,507 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Dec 1-18 grain exports at 654,507 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 654,507 tonnes between December 1 and December 18, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 381,000 tonnes in the whole of December 1995.</p>
<p>The 654,507 tonnes grain total included 577,346 tonnes of wheat and 77,161 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    South Africa		    17,000</p>
<p>    West Africa		     33,724</p>
<p>    Algeria			   50,100</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		  13,240</p>
<p>    Egypt			    113,885</p>
<p>    Finland			    2,920</p>
<p>    Britain			   15,850</p>
<p>    Italy			    165,310</p>
<p>    Morocco			   68,450</p>
<p>    Poland			    71,467</p>
<p>    Turkey			    25,400</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		    56,161</p>
<p>    Romania			   21,000</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
